          "en": "My friend came to pick me up at the station."
        },
        {
          "id": "l24_e04",
          "jp": "私は先生に作文を直してもらいました。",
          "zh": "我请老师帮我改了作文。",
          "en": "I had my teacher correct my essay."
        },
        {
          "id": "l24_e05",
